From fa051e9c97df3a2c13a21d1997974f3269e9f824 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tian <tian@sanchez-ballado.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:07:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add shot analysis, taste-first dial-in and calm live view
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- domain/shotAnalysis: Decent puck resistance (P/F²), abrupt relative drop
  detection guarded against stage changes, commanded target changes and the
  shot tail; choked-flow detection; first drops and breakdown shape.
- insights/dialIn: espresso-compass rules producing one next step from real
  dose/yield/grind; puck findings first; yield before grind.
- Dial-in sheet on finished live pulls and Insights shot detail, with chart
  markers; device-local taste journal.
- Calm live view preference (ring + stage) toggled from the live header.
- scripts/analyze-shots.ts calibration helper (read-only).
- en/es/fr/it/zh drafts with provenance; review page; docs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015NuaqczNcFBQoTF56BhAqz
